OL,3,GNEWSAShop shut down after illegal
OL,4,Acigarette stash found
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn off-licence has been ordered to
OL,7,Fclose for three months after thousands
OL,8,Fof illegal cigarettes were discovered.
OL,10,FDurham County Council's trading
OL,11,Fstandards officers received tip-offs
OL,12,Ffrom members of the public that The
OL,13,FAvenue store, in Deneside, Seaham, was
OL,14,Fselling illegal tobacco products in
OL,15,FJuly.
OL,17,FAfter carrying out a series of test
OL,18,Fpurchases, the team inspected the
OL,19,Fpremises with support from Durham
OL,20,FPolice.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
