OL,3,GNEWSAShop shut down after illegal
OL,4,Acigarette stash found
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers found a large haul of
OL,7,Fcigarettes and hand rolling tobacco
OL,8,Fstashed in an outbuilding at the back
OL,9,Fof the shop, including 215 packets
OL,10,Fcontaining 4,360 illicit cigarettes.
